# SPA fallback: the app uses BrowserRouter, so deep links like /dashboard or
# /reset-password have no file on disk. Without this rule the static host returns
# 404 on refresh or direct navigation. Serve index.html for any unmatched path
# and let the client router resolve it. Supported by Render and Netlify static
# hosting; Vite copies this file from public/ into dist/ at build time.
/*    /index.html   200
